[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15002.55, "timestamp": "04:10:02", "text": "好的。看看黑市。破坏者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15012.63, "timestamp": "04:10:12", "text": "那也是一个不错的指标。维克"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15014.55, "timestamp": "04:10:14", "text": "维克的市场行情好得离谱，不会就此止步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15017.83, "timestamp": "04:10:17", "text": "说谎。就像《Rea Ghost》和《Iron Frenzy》一样，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15024.469, "timestamp": "04:10:24", "text": "比如，给我展示一下你的目标市场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15027.429, "timestamp": "04:10:27", "text": "我会通过公开聊天发送。好的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15029.67, "timestamp": "04:10:29", "text": "是的，我能看到你。我能看到你。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15031.99, "timestamp": "04:10:31", "text": "什么是地平线狂热？看起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15039.79, "timestamp": "04:10:39", "text": "我的天哪，黑市。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15043.269, "timestamp": "04:10:43", "text": "哦，看起来不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15045.349, "timestamp": "04:10:45", "text": "这可能是任何游戏中的默认皮肤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15049.67, "timestamp": "04:10:49", "text": "游戏本身是免费的，但在《Valor》中，它是付费游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15051.349, "timestamp": "04:10:51", "text": "是的。黑市的问题在于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15054.229, "timestamp": "04:10:54", "text": "切换之后，枪的运作方式就改变了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15055.75, "timestamp": "04:10:55", "text": "外观取决于你是否在进攻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15059.59, "timestamp": "04:10:59", "text": "或进行防守。是的。"}]